# Tests

Write the assertion that fails if the behavior is removed. Use Vitest. No AWS account and no network.

```typescript
// Bad: locks copy and Block Kit structure the product does not depend on
expect(blocks).toMatchSnapshot();

// Good: the even game from the README, and the button that must exist
expect(applyGame(evenTeams, "home")).toEqual({
  winners: [1016, 1016],
  losers: [984, 984],
});
expect(actionIds(render(openWithFour))).toContain("game_start");
expect(actionIds(render(openWithThree))).toEqual([
  "game_join",
  "game_leave",
  "game_cancel",
]);
```

Cover transitions, rating numbers, and repository conditions (double join, fifth player, double save). Handler tests assert replace versus ephemeral. Do not assert that a mock was called and stop there.
